n":"icon-caret__right","margin_top":32}},"collapsible_tab_9B6dEw":{"type":"collapsible_tab","settings":{"title":"Lead Times","content":"<p>Please allow <strong>1-3 weeks<\/strong> from purchase for delivery on all Special Order items.<\/p><p>To confirm lead times on a specific product, please&nbsp;<a href=\"mailto:%20support@shopembark.com\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"mailto:%20support@shopembark.com\">email<\/a> our team or call\/text us at (337) 385-9945.<\/p><p>*Pricing may fluctuate with the Gold Market<\/p>","page":"","open_as_drawer":false,"icon":"icon-caret__right","margin_top":32}},"collapsible_tab_7UEcPg":{"type":"collapsible_tab","settings":{"title":"Jewelry Care","content":"<p><strong>Our jewelry is made with love and can be worn daily, however, it should be handled with care!&nbsp;<\/strong><\/p><p>To ensure longevity, we recommend the following:<\/p><p>- Remove all demi-fine jewelry before showering, swimming, and sweating. Our waterproof & fine jewelry can handle those activities, but should still be handled with care.&nbsp;<\/p><p>- Rings should be removed before exercising and any other strenuous activity using your hands.<\/p><p>- Apply perfume, lotion, and hairspray on first, then your jewelry.<\/p><p>- Store your chain jewelry in your EMBARK pouch with the clasp left out to prevent tangling.&nbsp;&nbsp;<\/p><p>- Clean your fine jewelry with our bestselling <a href=\"\/products\/jewelry-cleaner-bundle\" title=\"Jewelry Cleaner Bundle\">jewelry cleaning products<\/a>, otherwise, warm water, mild soap and a delicate toothbrush will do the trick!&nbsp;<\/p><p>Please be aware that due to the unique nature of the materials used - colors, shapes, and sizes may vary slightly from the images and descriptions.&nbsp;<\/p><p><strong>Embark is not responsible for any damages after 60 days.<\/strong><\/p>","page":"","open_as_drawer":false,"icon":"icon-caret__right","margin_top":0}},"collapsible_tab_bDkCcD":{"type":"collapsible_tab","settings":{"title":"Shipping 